title: "Dataset construction pipeline for energy benchmarking of South Korean medical institutions"
abstract: >-
  Data processing pipeline that builds a nationwide energy benchmarking dataset
  for South Korean medical institutions. The code merges the national building
  register, Health Insurance Review and Assessment Service (HIRA) institutional
  records, monthly metered energy use, and weather station observations into a
  single institution-level dataset, then applies the filtering and screening
  steps described in the accompanying manuscript.
